# SQL Server backend support (AAP-98732).
# Installed by the py312-mssql tox environments and by the local-only dev
# image profile; the published runtime image carries this stack only when
# built with INCLUDE_MSSQL_DRIVER=true (it must not contain Microsoft's
# ODBC driver binaries otherwise — the driver is installed or configured
# at runtime/startup instead). The ODBC stack stays out of the base
# requirements so environments that are not in the SQL Server tech
# preview (including Python 3.11) never need unixODBC.
# Pins track django-ansible-base's requirements_all.txt so the dev image and
# base tox environments (which install DAB's lockfile after this one) do not
# silently change versions out from under the py312-mssql environments.
mssql-django
mssql-python==1.17.0
mssql-python-rs==0.4.0
pyodbc==5.4.0
dispatcherd[sqlserver]  # the sql_server Service Broker broker
